  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You fill a creature you can see within range with self-doubt. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have Disadvantage on D20 Tests for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-3FGWzms0l8yQDwhO\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect gives the Disadvantage on ability checks and saving throws; apply it to the target’s attack rolls by hand.</p></section>",
